Material taken from Harness v2:

- skills/harnesskit/references/harness/*.md
  Copied without changes from skills/harness/references/.

- skills/harnesskit/references/mode-build.md
  Derived from skills/harness/SKILL.md. Modified by HarnessKit:
  the inventory now covers user-level skills, plugins, hooks, output styles
  and MCP servers; external skills are reused before new ones are generated;
  a pre-work check step is added to generated orchestrators; a
  harnesskit.lock record is written; Codex output, including how
  Claude model tiers map to Codex reasoning settings, points to codex.md;
  and token-saving design rules (tool-call caps, script-based measurement,
  change-only re-checks, iteration limits, anti-pattern check before
  approval) and a run-operations block (token ledger, one run per
  session, handoff prompt; see token-ops.md) are added.

- skills/harnesskit/references/build-maintain.md
  Derived from skills/harness/SKILL.md (phase 0 branch table, v1 migration,
  phase 7 operations). Moved out of mode-build.md so a fresh build does not
  read it. Modified by HarnessKit: missing token ledger or tool-call caps
  in an existing harness are reported.

- skills/harnesskit/references/mode-evolve.md
  Derived from skills/evolve/SKILL.md. Modified by HarnessKit:
  consolidation runs before new rules are added, the conflict check is
  re-run after every change, harnesskit.lock is updated, and token-cost
  feedback is traced through the token ledger to specific fixes.

Each derived file states at its top that it was changed.
